{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0001", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "You found it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 15}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0002", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Hard as hell to miss once you're looking for it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 17}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0003", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "This is not the tower.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 21}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0004", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Good morning to you too.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 23}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0005", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "The tower on the copy was enormous. This fort is aggressively ordinary.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 25}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0006", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "Which is why we're looking before we decide the map was wrong.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 27}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0007", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Some of this isn't Crown work.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 31}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0008", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "No. Fort's sitting on something bigger.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 35}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0009", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Much bigger.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NEXT MORNING — NORMAL CRESTHAVEN]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 39}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0010", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Here.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 59}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0011", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "That's really fucking subtle.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 63}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0012", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "It was subtle while a floor was sitting on it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 65}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0013", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Mirena.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 69}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0014", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "How far?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 75}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0015", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Don't know yet.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 77}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0016", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "Then the four of you check it. We keep the fort clear up here.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 79}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0017", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Sensible command decision. Disturbing trend today.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 83}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0018", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "You'll recover.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[FOUNDATION ACCESS]", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 87}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0019", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "There.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 101}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0020", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "The tower was this fucking wide?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 103}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0021", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Foundation was.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 105}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0022", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Which is enough to stop calling the copy exaggerated.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 107}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0023", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Any idea what the tower did?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 109}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0024", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "No. Big is not a function. Important-looking is not a function either, before anybody tries that shit.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 113}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0025", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "I hadn't fucking said anything.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 115}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0026", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Preventive maintenance.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SHORT STOP — SCALE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 117}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0027", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "That one's fucking intact.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[WARDEN CHAMBER]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 135}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0028", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Large, armed, not moving. I am not upgrading that to safe.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[WARDEN CHAMBER]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 137}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0029", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Hold.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE ASSESSMENT]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 149}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0030", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "It's responding to us.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE ASSESSMENT]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 155}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0031", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "To us individually, or what the hell?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE ASSESSMENT]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_CRESTHAVEN_TOWER_BASE_FIRST_COMMAND_WARDEN_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 157}},
